# every CodeQL code-scanning thread fell through the loop's bot-author gate
# as "non-bot author" and --resolve-actioned / --auto-resolve-bots could
# never touch it — a disposed CodeQL finding's thread could only be
# resolved by hand. Same fixture shape as Test 5, GraphQL's un-suffixed
# login form (author{login} returns "github-advanced-security", not
# "github-advanced-security[bot]").
echo
